17008563,2025-11-04,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account status incorrect,"XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX I am writing to formally dispute multiple late payments reported on my credit file, which are inaccurate due to unauthorized access and account tampering involving my personal information.

