17103972,2025-11-07,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account status incorrect,"Subject : False Late Payment Reporting, Willful Noncompliance, and Unlawful Delay of Investigation by Experian, Equifax, and TransUnion I am filing this complaint because all three credit bureaus Experian, Equifax, and TransUnion have continued to report false late payments on my XXXX XXXX account # XXXX, despite multiple formal disputes and supporting documentation proving that the account was paid on time and has maintained a {$0.00} balance since closure.

