17316881,2025-11-19,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"Formal Demand to Block Fraudulent Account Under FCRA 605B Identity Theft Victim Notification This is a formal follow-up regarding unresolved fraudulent account that remain on my Equifax credit report despite multiple disputes. I got a letter from Equifax that violates my rights under the FCRA. This letter is not a repeat of prior submissions it includes documentation and a renewed demand for legal compliance under the Fair Credit Reporting Act, Section 605B ( 15 U.S.C. 1681c-2 ). 
