17367053,2025-11-19,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"I recently reviewed my credit report and found something deeply concerning. There is an account reporting ( XXXX  XXXX ) that I never authorized. I did not open it, I did not give permission for it to appear on my file, and I certainly did not consent for it to be reported to any credit bureau. 
